### Criar SocialProfile do creator
POST http://{{host}}/api/creator/socialProfile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "Platform_user_name": "Kazoziiii",
  "Link": "https://www.youtube.com/@KazzioProva",
  "Description": "Adoro fazer pranks",
  "Followers_count": 4,
  "PriceMin": 10.00,
  "PriceMax": 20.00,  
  "PlatformId": 2,
  "Sectors": ["Automotive & Mobility", "Pets"]
}

### Get all platforms
GET http://{{host}}/api/socialPlatform
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### apagar platform do creator
DELETE http://{{host}}/api/creator/socialProfile/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}


### Get platform do creator
GET http://{{host}}/api/creator/socialProfile/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}


### Edit CreateSocialProfile erro 500 quando tentamos edi
POST http://{{host}}/api/creator/socialProfile/edit/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "PlatformUserName": "abfiuabw",
  "Link": "https://www.youtube.com/@titio",
  "Description": "Afinal nao adoro assim tanto fazer pranks",
  "Sectors": ["Automotive & Mobility", "Pets", "Real Estate"],
  "FollowersCount": 1,
  "PriceMin": 10.00,
  "PriceMax": 70.00
}

### Obter todos os sectores disponíveis
GET http://{{host}}/api/sectors
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

